  "schema": "parcimonia.assessment-corpus/v1",
  "notes": [
    "Human expectations, not recorded current outputs. baseline_source_revision identifies the source against which the original cases were designed.",
    "Tool inventories are controlled metadata fixtures, not proof that a Codex host exposes these tools or has verified their capabilities.",
    "Only expect fields are graded in the deterministic assessment evaluation; codex fields describe future behavioral criteria and do not record executed model evaluation.",
    "The regression and challenge labels describe fixed public authored cases. Neither label denotes an independent holdout, and replaying them does not measure generalization.",
